#: includes/admin/views/settings-emails.php:36
msgid "Hello [user-name],<br><br>Your review for [group-name] on [site-name] was not approved by the group administrator.<br><br>If you have questions about our community guidelines, please contact the group admin.<br><br>Thank you for your understanding.<br><br>Best regards,<br>The [site-name] Team"
