#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:17
msgid "About BuddyPress Group Reviews"
msgstr "À propos de BuddyPress Group Reviews"

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:21
msgid "BuddyPress Group Reviews lets members add reviews for groups and rate them across multiple criteria. Submitted reviews appear in the group's \"Manage Reviews\" section, where admins approve or deny them. Approved reviews show in the group's \"Reviews\" tab. Add as many rating criteria as you need."
msgstr "BuddyPress Group Reviews permet aux membres d'ajouter des avis sur les groupes et de les évaluer selon plusieurs critères. Les avis soumis apparaissent dans la section « Gérer les avis » du groupe, où les administrateurs les approuvent ou les refusent. Les avis approuvés s'affichent dans l'onglet « Avis » du groupe. Ajoute autant de critères d'évaluation que tu en as besoin."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:29
msgid "If you need assistance, here are some helpful resources. Our documentation is a great place to start, and our support team is available if you require further help."
